# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# ============================================================
# 🔥 DEPENDENCIES
# ============================================================
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# ============================================================
